  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Refactor CSV handling and enhance task management\n   This commit introduces significant refactoring and enhancements across the codebase, focusing on CSV handling and task management. Key changes include:\n   - New namespace `SharpBoxesCore.Office.CSV` for better organization of CSV-related classes.\n   - Added `ExcelExporter` and `IExcelExporter` for Excel file operations using the `MiniExcel` library.\n   - Implemented `BackgroundTaskManager` for managing background tasks with cancellation and timeout support.\n   - Introduced `DataCenter` for generic data storage with lifecycle management and event notifications.\n   - Added extension methods for `Dictionary{TKey, TValue=\"\"}` to simplify adding or updating entries.\n   - Introduced `PathHelper` for improved file path manipulation.\n   - Added logging capabilities via `ILogger` interface and `ConsoleLogger` implementation.\n   - Improved error handling, logging, and overall code organization for better maintainability and usability.",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "集成了一些常用的方法； 如通用的缓存静态操作类、通用的反射加载dll类LibLoadHelper、HTTPHelper、IniHelper、XMLHelper、ZipHelper、CSVHelper、Preview Features Import、ClassHelper、EventHelper、ValidationHelper其他是一些通用的扩展方法类",
